# Database layer ownership

- **Write**: `server/src/models/**`, `server/src/db/**`, `server/src/scripts/**` (migrations/backfills). `shared/src/**` only when persistence-related contracts require it.
- **Do not**: change controllers, routes, integration adapters, or frontend. Do not embed business orchestration in models.

Align with `.agents/database/AGENTS.md`. If this change needs new API shapes, coordinate `shared` contracts and hand off to Backend after schemas are stable.
